            "description": "free(msg[index]) is called at 0x158e. The pointer in msg[index] is freed but no subsequent instruction sets msg[index] = NULL."
          },
          {
            "id": "E002",
            "type": "STATIC",
            "function": "eat_cookie",
            "address": "0x15b0-0x15c6",
            "description": "Swap-remove: msg[cookie_num-1] is loaded and written into msg[index]. When index == cookie_num-1, this writes the freed pointer back into the same slot, creating a dangling pointer."
          },
          {
            "id": "E003",
            "type": "STATIC",
            "function": "eat_cookie",
            "address": "0x15ff-0x160a",
            "description": "cookie_num is decremented but msg[index] is not nulled. No NULL assignment instruction exists between free (0x158e) and ret (0x1627)."
